@startuml
title Tabel Referensi - Pengelolaan Booking Vendor (Jejak Rimba)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam noteBorderColor #4A5568

note as T1
**Tabel Transisi Status Vendor**
|===
| Status Awal | Aksi Vendor | Status Baru | Syarat
| menunggu_konfirmasi | Mengonfirmasi | dikonfirmasi | Stok tersedia
| dikonfirmasi | Mulai Sewa | sedang_berjalan | Tanggal mulai tercapai
| sedang_berjalan | Terima Kembali | selesai | Alat lengkap & baik
| * (selain selesai) | Batalkan | dibatalkan | Alasan valid
|===
end note

note as T2
**Tabel Aktor & Tanggung Jawab**
|===
| Aktor | Aktivitas Utama
| Vendor | Lihat booking masuk, konfirmasi, terima kembali, batalkan, update status
| Sistem | Verifikasi kepemilikan, update DB, revalidasi cache, hitung stok otomatis
|===
end note

note as T3
**Tabel Decision Points**
|===
| Decision Point | Guard True | Guard False
| Milik Vendor? | [Ya] → lanjut lihat status | [Tidak] → akses ditolak
| Status Booking? | [Menunggu] → konfirmasi | [Sedang] → terima kembali
| | [Dibatalkan/Selesai] → info | [Lainnya] → error
|===
end note

note as T4
**Tabel Entitas Data**
|===
| Entitas | Field Penting
| bookings | id, renter_id, equipment_id, start_date, end_date, status, notes
| equipment | id, name, stock, vendor_id, condition
| vendors | id, profile_id, business_name, is_active
| profiles | id, full_name, role
|===
end note

@enduml